Package: CrossCurveR
Title: Multi-Curve Yield Modelling and Stress Testing
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "TODO", family = "Author", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for estimating, examining, and stress-testing multiple
    yield curves using Diebold-Li-Yue (DLY) models and covariance-regression-based
    multi-curve estimation (MCE), with supporting curve reconstruction and
    actuarial applications.
